OL,3,GNEWSAThefts leave hospice charity staff
OL,4,A'deflated'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at a hospice charity say they
OL,7,Fhave been left "deflated" after a
OL,8,Fseries of thefts from their shop.
OL,10,FRotherham Hospice said thieves had
OL,11,Fstruck twice in the past two months.
OL,13,FIn the most recent incident on 14
OL,14,FSeptember, they said a man had walked
OL,15,Fout of the Parkgate branch with a pram
OL,16,Fand a number of electrical items,
OL,17,Fhaving earlier used counterfeit money
OL,18,Fto pay for a drink.
