OL,3,GNEWSAThefts leave hospice charity staff
OL,4,A'deflated'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCEO Mat Cottle-Shaw said he felt
OL,7,Fcharity shops were becoming a "prime
OL,8,Ftarget for people that are
OL,9,Funfortunately becoming ever more
OL,10,Fdesperate".
